<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan's FGEP buys 54,000T U.S. corn at tender.</title>
<headline>Taiwan's FGEP buys 54,000T U.S. corn at tender.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's FGEP corn procurement group bought one 54,000-tonne shipment of U.S. corn at a tender on Wednesday from Zennoh, traders said.  </p>
<p>The FGEP group comprises Fwu Sow Grain, Great Wall Enterprise, President Enterprises and Ever Smile Feed Mill Co.</p>
<p>Details for the tender are as follows:</p>
<p>U.S. Gulf    Pacific N.W.    90 UScents/May</p>
<p>One	 54,000   April 10-25  April 26-May 10</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
